voice-to-text (1.0.1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix GUI initialization overwriting model settings
  * Eliminate recording start latency (zero-latency mode)
  * Pre-open audio stream for instant recording response
  * Fix first syllables being lost due to stream initialization delay
  * Improve model selection persistence across restarts

